        "original_id": "4717b897-767d-54c8-9df5-420a0c88b8f1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Larry Gagosian, Steve Dildarian\n- Organizations: Gagosian Gallery, HBO\n- Products: The Life & Times of Tim\n- Places: Nathaniel L. McCready House\n\nFacts:\n- Larry Gagosian was born on April 19, 1945.\n- Larry Gagosian is an Armenian American art dealer.\n- Larry Gagosian owns the Gagosian Gallery chain of art galleries.\n- Steve Dildarian was born on November 3, 1969.\n- Steve Dildarian is an American former advertising copywriter.\n- Steve Dildarian created, wrote, produced, and voiced Tim in HBO's animated television series The Life & Times of Tim, which ran from 2008 to 2012.\n- In 2011, Larry Gagosian purchased the Nathaniel L. McCready House.\n- In 2011, Larry Gagosian demolished the interior of the Nathaniel L. McCready House mansion.",
